# Crystal Imperium play test: Emerald Imperium's base stats (DECISIONS.md D50), from its official dex,
# where they differ from Heart & Soul's: 294 species, most of them buffed. Farfetch'd has 75 HP (52),
# so a level-50 one has 150 HP with Minimal Grinding's 31 IVs (127 before); Raichu's Attack and
# Sp. Atk are 100 (90 each); Sunflora's Sp. Atk is 135 (105); Flareon's total stays 525 with its
# Speed 95 (65); a species Imperium doesn't change keeps its own (Bulbasaur's Speed, 45).
!new_game()
!expect_base_stat("SPECIES_FARFETCHD", "baseHP", 75)
!expect_base_stat("SPECIES_FARFETCHD", "baseDefense", 70)
!expect_base_stat("SPECIES_RAICHU", "baseAttack", 100)
!expect_base_stat("SPECIES_RAICHU", "baseSpAttack", 100)
!expect_base_stat("SPECIES_SUNFLORA", "baseSpAttack", 135)
!expect_base_stat("SPECIES_FLAREON", "baseSpeed", 95)
!expect_base_stat("SPECIES_FLAREON", "baseSpAttack", 65)
!expect_base_stat("SPECIES_BULBASAUR", "baseSpeed", 45)
# A level-50 Farfetch'd's HP, from its new base stat (struct Pokemon's maxHP, +88)
!give_mon(83, 50)
expect16 {gPlayerParty+88} 150 farfetchd_level_50_has_150_hp
